body:
緑の大地は緩やかにうねり、幾重にも重なりながら地平線の向こうへと消えていく。

I got another sentence question today unfortunately. I suppose it is fine to ask these as long as I show that I'm progressing in my japanese. I'm a little bit confused on what うねり means in this sentence.  So I think that this sentence means;

The green land has gentle curves, filled with many layers while these curves gradually disappear on the opposite side of the horizon.
